knowledge_vault_runner:
  llm_offline: |
    api.deepseek.com unreachable (DNS/network) — wikilinks/retag/reprocess skipped.

    Maintenance continues without LLM (hubs, duplicates, reports).

  dup_delete_marker: "удалить:"
  dup_cap_exceeded: |
    ⛔ apply_duplicates: {count} files to delete > limit {max_delete}.

    Auto-apply cancelled — run manually:

    singleton_regex: 'Тегов с 1 заметкой:\s*(\d+)'

    singleton_suggestion: |

    🏷 <b>Singleton tags</b>: found {count} tags used in only 1 note.

    To remove noise from the graph, run:

    refill_ok_line: '^Итого refill:|llm_errors\s*=\s*0'

  slug_skip_substr: "Slug всё ещё в RE_BAD"
  more_lines_suffix: "\n… and {n} more lines"
  maintenance_warnings_header: "🔧 <b>Vault maintenance</b> finished with warnings:\n\n"

